	<element name="Weaver-Educated" type="Background" source="ATÉRIOR" id="ID_ATERIOR_BACKGROUND_WEAVER_EDUCATED">
		<description>
			<ul class="unstyled" style="text-indent:-1em; margin-left:1em; margin-bottom:5px">
				<li><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma</li>
				<li><strong>Feat:</strong> Keen Mind</li>
				<li><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and History</li>
				<li><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Calligrapher's Supplies</li>
				<li><strong>Equipment:</strong><i> Choose A or B:</i> (A) Book (philosophy), Ink and Ink Pen, Parchment (10 sheets), Traveler's Clothes, 15 GP; or (B) 50 GP</li>
			</ul>
			<p>You came up through Lorevale's college philosophy scene — the same intellectual soil the Cult of the Weaver grew from — without joining a sect yourself. You know the arguments, the appeal, and the warning signs.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="short">Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma, Keen Mind Feat, Arcana and History Skills, Calligrapher's Supplies</set>
		</setters>
		<rules>
			<grant type="Ability Score Improvement" id="ID_INTERNAL_ABILITY_SCORE_IMPROVEMENT_COMBINATION_INT_WIS_CHA" />
			<grant type="Feat" id="ID_PHB_FEAT_KEENMIND" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_ARCANA" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_HISTORY" />
			<grant type="Grants" id="ID_INTERNAL_GRANTS_BACKGROUND_ASI" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_TOOL_PROFICIENCY_CALLIGRAPHERS_SUPPLIES" />
		</rules>
	</element>
